tor calibrated by latitude and biome guarantees 100% playable game without any internet connection."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_lod_pipeline", "label": "4-Stage Terrain LOD Pipeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE_1_TO_1_SCALE_TERRAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hierarchical detail transitions: Orbital View (1000km-150km, CubeSpherePlanet 8K map/normals), Meso Transition (150km-15km, TerrainDataService zoom 7-10 tiles), Regional/Municipal View (15km-2km, CDLOD quadtrees), Ground View (2km-1m, GPU displacement)."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_floating_origin_precision", "label": "Floating Origin and 64-bit Precision Coordinates", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE_1_TO_1_SCALE_TERRAIN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unity single-precision 32-bit floats jitter beyond 10,000m. FloatingOrigin.cs centers active sector at (0,0,0) scene space while global planetary positions are maintained in 64-bit double Vector3d across 40,000 km circumference."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_architecture_terrain_document", "target": "docs_architecture_scale_1_to_1_challenge", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE_1_TO_1_SCALE_TERRAIN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture_terrain_document", "target": "docs_architecture_hybrid_streaming", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE_1_TO_1_SCALE_TERRAIN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture_hybrid_streaming", "target": "docs_architecture_scale_1_to_1_challenge", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE_1_TO_1_SCALE_TERRAIN